# NiyamKosh · नियमकोश

Smart India Hackathon 2026 · Problem Statement 26108 · Department of Consumer Affairs

Finds the Indian Standard that governs a procurement specification, and audits a
published tender for citations that are withdrawn, certification clauses that are
missing, and standards comparable tenders cite but this one omits.

**2,087 standards · 220 real tenders · 3,336 co-citation edges · 737 certification
rules.** Every row traces to a BIS page or a published tender document.

## On this Space

The language model is not available on a free CPU Space, so composed clauses come
from the deterministic template — the interface labels every clause with how it
was produced. Everything else runs: hybrid retrieval, the four constraint
filters, the confidence gate, the tender audit, the co-citation graph, and twelve
interface languages.

Run locally with Ollama and `qwen2.5:7b-instruct-q4_K_M` for the full pipeline.
